    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDuncarraig is superb bungalow residence set on 1.5 acre site and located on a quiet road in Blueball.\nThe property is approached via limestone pillars and post and rail fence to a gravelled driveway.\nOnce inside one is immediately impressed with the spacious room sizes and light throughout the house. A generous entrance hallway leads to a large siting room with bay window. A door from here leads to a spacious kitchen which is well equipped with a range of units, wood pellet stove, a built in book case creates a natural divid from kitchen area to dining area. Patio doors lead to the back garden. Off the kitchen is a practical utility room with sink unit. A door from here leads to the back garden and deck.\nThere are four sizable double bedrooms ( 1 en suite) and a fully tiled bathroom which completes the accommodation.\nOutside are mature lawned gardens with trees such as Rowan, Ash, Copper Beach, Maple and Silver Birch. There is a large double garage with two roller doors and there is a further small shanette shed.\nThe location is highly convenient being within a short drive of Tullamore, Mucklagh and Kilcormac in a sought after area close to primary and secondary schools. \nViewing of this special family home is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.74m x 2.40m\nSpacious hallway, carpeted\n\nSitting Room - 5.25m x 4.77m\nLarge sitting room with baywindow and fireplace with gas coal effect fire. A door leads from here to the kitchen dining room.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 8.43m x 3.60m\nGenerous kitchen with extensive range of kitchen units. There is a wood pellet stove and a built in book case which gives a natural divide between kitchen and dining area. Patio doors lead from the dining area to the back garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.62m x 1.95m\nEquipped with a range of eye level and base level units, sink unit. Plumbed for washing machine. Door to back garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.63m x 4.94m\nSuperbly spacious room carpeted. Large range of built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.69m x 2.01m\nFully tiled, contains wc whb and shower enclosure with Triton T90op Electric Shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.14m x 3.49m\nDouble bedroom carpeted, built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.45m x 3.13m\nA lovely double bedroom with front aspect, built in wardrobes. Carpted.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.23m x 3.69m\nDouble bedroom wtih front aspect, carpeted.\n\nBathroom - 3.64m x 2m\nLarge fully tiled bathroom containing bath wc whb and separate shower enclosure wtih Aqualisa Shower.\n\nhotpress - \nShelved hotpress\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>OFCH</li><li>Wood Pellet Stove in kitchen dining room</li><li>Large double garage with two roller doors</li><li>Large attic suitable for conversion subject to Planning Permission</li><li>Alarm</li><li>Mature grounds surrounding the property with array of trees and carefully maintained lawns.</ul>"
      },
